# Care2Data
#
# Persistent identifiers for the ontologies and vocabularies published by Care2Data.
#
# https://w3id.org/care2data/<path> redirects to https://care2data.github.io/ns/<path>
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Gopinath (Care2Data)
# GitHub username: GopinathC2D

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://care2data.github.io/ns/$1 [R=302,L]
